// Ch13: the Archive's clerk. Before the reading, procedure; after it, he noticed.
title: ch13_bark_archivist
location: ch13/lamp_archive
---
<<if $ch13_archive_read>>
    Clerk as "Archivist" [worried]: You were a long time at the founders' shelf. Most people read the first page and go and pray. #line:ch13_bark_arch_001
<<else>>
    Clerk as "Archivist" [neutral]: Gloves, please. The ledgers are older than the Calm, and the Calm is old. #line:ch13_bark_arch_002
<<endif>>
===
